# --- Live league scrapes: contain personal data, never commit ---
# These are raw dumps of the logged-in Yahoo league page. They carry the real
# first names of all ten league managers, the league ID, and a LOGGED_IN_INDICATOR
# flag. Harmless while the repo was private; this repo is now PUBLIC, so they must
# stay out. The bot reads them from disk at runtime -- it just must not track them.
data/scrapes/

